WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.459 --> 00:00:02.460
Are you okay?

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:06.923
I'm sure Bartra
is complaining about me now.

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:08.842
Probably.

00:00:09.634 --> 00:00:12.345
Anyway, what's wrong with this place?

00:00:12.887 --> 00:00:16.891
There are not even walls for me
to break down.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:21.104
I wonder if Zeldris and Gelda are okay.

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:24.816
Dahlia and Dubs really got us good.

00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:27.861
About that.

00:00:28.653 --> 00:00:33.116
I remember that Dahlia
had no interest in the Holy War.

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:36.536
He disappeared without getting
involved with Stigma.

00:00:38.121 --> 00:00:41.332
Dubs also created
the Coffin of Eternal Darkness

00:00:41.416 --> 00:00:43.376
to end the Holy War.

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:49.382
But suddenly, they come out
and say we ruined the Holy War?

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:52.260
That really is strange.

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:53.553
Also,

00:00:53.636 --> 00:00:56.389
I don't remember them being so powerful.

00:00:56.473 --> 00:00:58.058
I wonder what happened?

00:00:58.767 --> 00:01:00.727
In order to find that answer,

00:01:01.436 --> 00:01:03.980
we'll need to get out of here first.

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:06.733
Thousand God Slayer!

00:01:16.701 --> 00:01:19.788
Well… What to do now?

00:01:20.288 --> 00:01:22.916
I'm sure they'll come to save us soon.

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:24.542
I doubt that.

00:01:24.584 --> 00:01:28.588
Ban and the others don't
know we're in the Demon Realm.

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:31.091
I meant Zeldris!

00:01:31.841 --> 00:01:36.262
I don't know about that. I'm his
traitorous and oathbreaking brother.

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:41.518
I followed him into the Demon Realm
even though he didn't like it.

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:46.106
Now, now. You want Zeldris
to believe in you, right?

00:01:46.189 --> 00:01:49.275
You need to believe in him too.

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:54.030
Families believe in each
other no matter what.

00:01:54.823 --> 00:01:59.202
My father and sisters taught me that.

00:01:59.828 --> 00:02:04.332
Let's go save everyone in
Britannia once we get out of here.

00:02:04.874 --> 00:02:07.836
Once that's done, we can return to Liones.

00:02:08.419 --> 00:02:10.630
Together, right?

00:02:11.589 --> 00:02:14.634
Right. We have a lot to do.

